  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115584",
      "title": "Supporting Content Projection with Multiple Slots",
      "lectureOrder": 107,
      "videoOrder": 101,
      "sourceHash": "ab29a9f7d9ec048fb3c8f7b921b82f8895025cad78a04a7dca48ba9cabb8680c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 1.95,
          "en": "So now that we worked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.95,
          "end": 4.41,
          "en": "on this button selector here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.41,
          "end": 6.72,
          "en": "I wanna work on its template as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.72,
          "end": 8.91,
          "en": "Because at the moment, the text logout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.91,
          "end": 12.18,
          "en": "and this icon is hardcoded into this template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.18,
          "end": 14.76,
          "en": "And that means that whenever we use this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.76,
          "end": 17.73,
          "en": "it will be that content that's being output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.73,
          "end": 19.14,
          "en": "Now that's fine in the header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.14,
          "end": 21.6,
          "en": "because I copied that content from there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.6,
          "end": 23.82,
          "en": "So it is the content I want to have there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.82,
          "end": 26.07,
          "en": "but if I now were to use my button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.07,
          "end": 27.96,
          "en": "in the new ticket component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 27.96,
          "end": 31.05,
          "en": "I'd end up with the wrong markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.05,
          "end": 33.69,
          "en": "So here in that new ticket component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.69,
          "end": 38.04,
          "en": "if I temporarily comment out this markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.04,
          "end": 39.903,
          "en": "so that it's not rendered anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.74,
          "end": 44.55,
          "en": "and I add appButton on this button element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.55,
          "end": 47.163,
          "en": "to use my custom button component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48,
          "end": 53,
          "en": "and I then also add my ButtonComponent to the imports,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.22,
          "end": 54.72,
          "en": "that's still required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.72,
          "end": 59.073,
          "en": "to unlock this component in this component template here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.97,
          "end": 63.536,
          "en": "If I do all that, you'll see that if I save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.536,
          "end": 67.44,
          "en": "and if I reload, we now also have the text logout here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.44,
          "end": 69.75,
          "en": "and that's, of course, wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.75,
          "end": 71.91,
          "en": "So what we need to do here is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.91,
          "end": 74.03999999999999,
          "en": "we need to make this button configurable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.03999999999999,
          "end": 78.09,
          "en": "or make the template of the button configurable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.09,
          "end": 82.12,
          "en": "And we could do that with help of inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.12,
          "end": 85.47,
          "en": "So with @Input or the input function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.47,
          "end": 88.68,
          "en": "we could accept one input for the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.68,
          "end": 91.32,
          "en": "and one input for the icon, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.32,
          "end": 93.57300000000001,
          "en": "which technically is also just the text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.56,
          "end": 96.03,
          "en": "that would be absolutely fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.03,
          "end": 98.82,
          "en": "But here also to show you a different pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.82,
          "end": 102.93299999999999,
          "en": "and a different Angular feature, I'll not do it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.03999999999999,
          "end": 107.91,
          "en": "instead, why don't we use ng-content here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 110.223,
          "en": "This placeholder, why don't we use that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.50999999999999,
          "end": 115.75,
          "en": "And why don't we also use it here for the icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.36,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "so that we have two placeholders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 122.793,
          "en": "for these two different places in our markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.63,
          "end": 125.34,
          "en": "If we do it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.34,
          "end": 128.58,
          "en": "we can go back to the header component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.58,
          "end": 131.1,
          "en": "And now here, between the button tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.1,
          "end": 135.183,
          "en": "we could add the logout text and this icon symbol.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.61,
          "end": 141.03,
          "en": "And in the new ticket component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.03,
          "end": 145.56,
          "en": "I'll comment that back in, remove those spans,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.56,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "since it's just the text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 149.67000000000002,
          "en": "and the icon I wanna pass into the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 152.043,
          "en": "and I'll put it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.96,
          "end": 156.24,
          "en": "Well, if we do that and we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.24,
          "end": 159.813,
          "en": "it looks almost right, but it's not entirely right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.74,
          "end": 163.323,
          "en": "which we can also confirm if we inspect this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.52,
          "end": 167.94,
          "en": "If we inspect this, we see that now actually, the content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.94,
          "end": 171.39,
          "en": "so the text and the icon text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.39,
          "end": 174.99,
          "en": "was rendered between the second span text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.99,
          "end": 177.903,
          "en": "and the first pair of span texts are empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.52,
          "end": 181.86,
          "en": "And that makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.86,
          "end": 185.25,
          "en": "because if we're using ng-content multiple times",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.25,
          "end": 186.51,
          "en": "in a template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.51,
          "end": 188.7,
          "en": "Angular, of course, doesn't know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.7,
          "end": 191.28,
          "en": "which content should go where.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.28,
          "end": 194.97,
          "en": "So which projected content should go where?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.97,
          "end": 197.31,
          "en": "Therefore we have to tell Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.31,
          "end": 199.797,
          "en": "which content should go where.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.797,
          "end": 203.31,
          "en": "And you can tell Angular by adding a special property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.31,
          "end": 208.31,
          "en": "a special attribute on ng-content, the select attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.39,
          "end": 215.39,
          "en": "Select then wants a CSS selector in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 216.32999999999998,
          "end": 219.99,
          "en": "and it accepts the same kind of selectors you could set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 219.99,
          "end": 222.393,
          "en": "on components as selectors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 223.41,
          "end": 226.07999999999998,
          "en": "and it will then select and output any content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 226.07999999999998,
          "end": 229.53,
          "en": "that matches the selector specified here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.53,
          "end": 231.3,
          "en": "So for example, here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 231.3,
          "end": 234.753,
          "en": "we could use the class selector icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 235.769,
          "end": 240.42,
          "en": "and remove this span with the class icon from this template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 240.42,
          "end": 242.703,
          "en": "so that I just have ng-content here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 243.66,
          "end": 247.413,
          "en": "and I'm looking for elements with the icon class on them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 251.19,
          "en": "and now in the place where we use the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 251.19,
          "end": 253.263,
          "en": "So in the header component, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.22,
          "end": 257.64,
          "en": "we can now wrap this icon text with that span",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.64,
          "end": 259.323,
          "en": "that has this clause.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 260.76,
          "end": 262.14,
          "en": "And of course, we can do the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 262.14,
          "end": 264.51,
          "en": "in the new ticket component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 264.51,
          "end": 269.51,
          "en": "Here, I'll wrap this icon with my span like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 276.39,
          "end": 278.76,
          "en": "So with that, between those button tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 278.76,
          "end": 282.15,
          "en": "we have some text which is not wrapped with anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 282.15,
          "end": 284.77,
          "en": "And we have the icon text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 284.77,
          "end": 288.39300000000003,
          "en": "which is wrapped by a span with class icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 289.98,
          "end": 293.01,
          "en": "Now, both pieces of content are wrapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 293.01,
          "end": 294.21,
          "en": "by the button component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 294.21,
          "end": 299.07,
          "en": "and they are therefore projected into that button component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 299.07,
          "end": 300.87,
          "en": "And in the button component template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 300.87,
          "end": 305.13,
          "en": "ng-content tells Angular where this wrapped,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 305.13,
          "end": 308.58,
          "en": "this projected content should be output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 308.58,
          "end": 311.76,
          "en": "But we're actually using multiple ng-contents here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 311.76,
          "end": 314.31,
          "en": "and we're therefore using this ng-content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 314.31,
          "end": 317.64,
          "en": "with the select property set on it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 317.64,
          "end": 321,
          "en": "to select a part of the wrapped content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 321,
          "end": 324.99,
          "en": "in this case, the part that has the icon class on it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 324.99,
          "end": 326.823,
          "en": "so this span here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 328.11,
          "end": 331.26,
          "en": "And this span will then be output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 331.26,
          "end": 332.943,
          "en": "in place of this ng-content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 334.38,
          "end": 336.18,
          "en": "The other ng-content element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 336.18,
          "end": 338.31,
          "en": "which does not have any configuration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 338.31,
          "end": 340.38,
          "en": "will then output any content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 340.38,
          "end": 343.92,
          "en": "that's not matched by some other ng-content element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 343.92,
          "end": 346.56,
          "en": "So that's not selected in any specific way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 346.56,
          "end": 348.633,
          "en": "by another ng-content element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 349.62,
          "end": 353.37,
          "en": "So with this, if I save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 353.37,
          "end": 358.37,
          "en": "and I reload, you now see the icon is now properly again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 358.83,
          "end": 361.26,
          "en": "and if I inspect my buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 361.26,
          "end": 364.17,
          "en": "you can also see that it's now that logout text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 364.17,
          "end": 367.143,
          "en": "that's output between the first span elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 367.98,
          "end": 371.04,
          "en": "and the icon text that's output between the second pair",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 371.04,
          "end": 372.363,
          "en": "of span elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 373.95,
          "end": 376.65,
          "en": "And that's how you can use multiple ng-contents",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 376.65,
          "end": 380.43,
          "en": "to select different pieces of wrapped content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 380.43,
          "end": 383.22,
          "en": "and output them in different places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 383.22,
          "end": 387.9,
          "en": "of the component template, which is another Angular feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 387.9,
          "end": 390.663,
          "en": "that can come in handy from time to time.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
